The to-hit formula takes experience level into account (and
XL13 is only middle-of-the-road) but also luck.  It's possible
to be unable to hit something with luck 0 and unable to miss
it if you max out your luck.  Mjollnir's to-hit bonus is only
+1d5, small compared to 20 points of luck.  Oh, I think the
weapon's enchantment is also taken into account, but again,
this is small compared to 20 points of luck.

Your skill with the weapon type (in this case, war hammer)
also matters -- but not as much as luck and XL.

